{"en": "1441202177", "title": "Valider et libérer les résultats", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "note"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Vous utilisez une version antérieure ? La version précédente de cette page est "}, {"type": "text", "text": "PARTIE 13 : VALIDATION DES RÉSULTATS (VALIDATION BIOLOGIQUE)", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/284196875"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " dans l'ancien manuel."}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Guide pratique · Biologiste validateur", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "En bref"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "width": 760.0}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Objectif"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Revoir les résultats saisis et les libérer (valider), ou les renvoyer en reprise d'analyse."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Résultat obtenu"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Des résultats validés et libérés, ou des résultats signalés pour une reprise d'analyse."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Qui s'en charge"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Les biologistes validateurs. L'accès dépend des droits de l'utilisateur et peut être configuré par votre administrateur."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Avant de commencer"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Des résultats saisis et acceptés, en attente de validation."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Où"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menu principal → Validation."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La validation est l'étape de revue qui précède la libération des résultats. Les résultats en attente de validation sont accessibles par "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Routine", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (la liste de travail par unité de laboratoire), "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Par demande", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (numéro de laboratoire) ou "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Par date", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Chaque ligne affiche le résultat, son intervalle de référence et des cases à cocher pour l'accepter ou le renvoyer en reprise d'analyse."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Étape 1 : ouvrir la liste de travail de validation"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ouvrez le "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Menu principal ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "puis cliquez sur"}, {"type": "text", "text": " Validation", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1432, "alt": "valid 1.png", "id": "0d587de2-c675-484b-846b-89aea73d0abc", "collection": "contentId-1441202177", "type": "file", "height": 535}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Validation", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Choisissez un mode : "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Routine", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Par demande", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ou "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Par date", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1437, "alt": "choose validation.png", "id": "7253662a-cc4a-4276-b50d-b3327cfd42c3", "collection": "contentId-1441202177", "type": "file", "height": 484}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Choisir le mode", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Routine", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1439, "alt": "valid route.png", "id": "97ed5d8c-a642-4b40-9a7a-2ebd55fb0686", "collection": "contentId-1441202177", "type": "file", "height": 535}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquer sur Routine"}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Choisissez l'unité dans "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Sélectionnez l'unité de test", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (par exemple, Water Quality). Les résultats en attente de validation se chargent, chacun avec "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Résultat", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Intervalle de référence", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", "}, {"type": "text", "text": "U (k = 2)", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et les cases à cocher "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Enregistrer", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " / "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Reprendre l'analyse", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1469, "alt": "01-validation-water-quality.png", "id": "84acd235-8083-4920-a341-765f04bcbda6", "collection": "contentId-1441202177", "type": "file", "height": 900}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La liste de travail de validation : les résultats en attente de validation, avec des pastilles de résultat colorées, les cases Enregistrer / Reprendre l'analyse sur chaque ligne et des actions groupées.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Étape 2 : valider ou reprendre l'analyse"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Revoyez chaque résultat. La couleur de la pastille indique s'il est dans l'intervalle (vert) ou hors de l'intervalle ou signalé (orange). Cochez "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Enregistrer", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " pour accepter et valider un résultat."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1469, "alt": "01-validation-water-quality save.png", "id": "a65cadae-c972-47ee-a559-82b4ca284fdd", "collection": "contentId-1441202177", "type": "file", "height": 900}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Enregistrer", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Reprendre l'analyse", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " pour le renvoyer."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 1469, "alt": "01-validation-water-quality retest.png", "id": "4208b75f-9943-4ff1-aee1-7aa0d7898df1", "collection": "contentId-1441202177", "type": "file", "height": 900}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Reprendre l'analyse", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 3}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pour traiter plusieurs résultats à la fois, utilisez les actions d'en-tête "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Enregistrer tous les résultats normaux", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Enregistrer tous les résultats", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ou "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Reprendre toutes les analyses", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs":