 "attrs": {"panelType": "info"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Si les signatures électroniques sont activées, signez pour terminer ; le biologiste validateur a le dernier mot sur la libération."}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Description des champs"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "width": 760.0}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Colonne"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remarques"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Informations sur l'échantillon"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le numéro de laboratoire et les identifiants de l'échantillon."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Nom de l'analyse / Intervalle de référence"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "L'analyse et son intervalle de référence."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Résultat"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La valeur saisie ; la couleur de la pastille indique si elle est dans l'intervalle, ou hors de l'intervalle o